      "hands_back": "{\"items\":[{\"heading\":\"Sam\",\"body\":\"The cake was the best part of the day.\",\"row_id\":\"record:praise:d9cbfc282b44d3c7c2029ca5d06c3c92\"}],\"shown\":1,\"may_show_total\":1,\"held_back\":{\"not_approved\":1}} (a row whose words changed after approval is counted under changed_since_approved and not returned)."
